=== VERDICT ===
All gates passed on this device.  Interpretation guide:
  * anchor within a few % of 2.547 -> engine agrees with the RCWA/Meep
    lineage at unit-cell scale; ladder spread is the discretization
    uncertainty of the label.
  * the ETA table is measured, not estimated: scope SEEDS_PER_SIGMA in
    run_dataset.py (env PC_SEEDS_PER_SIGMA) to fit your GPU budget.
